RED (`npx vitest run src/data/plan-store.test.ts src/state/store.test.ts`):

```text
FAIL  src/data/plan-store.test.ts > plan-store — v6 extraction and explicit placement (#112) > materializes legacy placement from original position presence
AssertionError: expected [ false, false ] to deeply equal [ true, false ]

FAIL  src/state/store.test.ts > plans carry the graph (Stage 3 P3) > a pre-v5 positioned stage loads pinned — a subsequent switch does NOT re-slot it (Stage 10 P1)
